<Mod id="17e9218c-5ef7-47c5-b6ab-b522e6712c70" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Dolen2's Ethnic Diversity Unit Pack for VP</Name>
    <Stability>Beta</Stability>
    <Teaser>BETA5 - Unit Pack for Ethnic Diversity mod - Activate this first, then one of the scaling options</Teaser>
    <Description>Ethnic Diversity for Civilization V: Brave New World[NEWLINE]Hundreds of new unit models for diversity, with no change to gameplay.  See newunits.xlsm or forum thread on CivFanatics website for details.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Cannot be activated at the same time as Hulfgar's Modpack, Ethnic Units, or R.E.D. Modpack.</Description>
    <Authors>Gedemon, Nutty, Dolen2</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>All unit makers, CivFanatics</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <Homepage>http://forums.civfanatics.com/showthread.php?t=383375</Homepage>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
